Concept used:

Sum of the first N natural numbers = frac {N(N+ 1)}{2}

Calculation:

Sum of the first 60 natural numbers = frac {60(60 + 1)}{2}

Now, the average of the first 60 natural numbers = frac {60(60 + 1)}{2} div 60 = 30.5

**∴ The average of the first 60 natural numbers is 30.5.**
